Cell line: HEK. Prefix file IDs with HEK_ and use underscores, for example HEK_WT1 and HEK_MTRF1_MTRF1A_dKO3.
These are template slots: map them to actual libraries in sample_info.csv. Source examples may have fewer libraries or additional controls. Historical RF1/RF1a labels refer to MTRF1/MTRF1A; clone and batch IDs are retained.
