4. Detailed source workflow
Data processing for mtRF1/mtRF1a dKO ribose (based on mtRF1a processing)
Cutadapt:
Activate environment: conda activate cutadaptenv
Go to folder: cd /path/to/project/RF1a_data
Trim and filter reads:
cutadapt -a TGGAATTCTCGGGTGCCAAGG -o /path/to/project/RF1_RF1a_dKO/WT_cut.fastq.gz /path/to/project/RF1_RF1a_dKO/RPI1_S1_R1_001.fastq.gz --max-n 0.2 -m 25 -M 45 --cores 4
cutadapt -a TGGAATTCTCGGGTGCCAAGG -o /path/to/project/RF1_RF1a_dKO/RF1_RF1a_KO1_cut.fastq.gz /path/to/project/RF1_RF1a_dKO/RPI2_S2_R1_001.fastq.gz --max-n 0.2 -m 25 -M 45 --cores 4
cutadapt -a TGGAATTCTCGGGTGCCAAGG -o /path/to/project/RF1_RF1a_dKO/RF1_RF1a_KO2_cut.fastq.gz /path/to/project/RF1_RF1a_dKO/RPI3_S3_R1_001.fastq.gz --max-n 0.2 -m 25 -M 45 --cores 4
Alignment polyA + UTR
Bowtie 2 (alignment)
Activate environment: conda activate bowtie2
Reference sequence: Human_mtDNA_polyA2.fasta.fai (contains polyA tails)
Annotation file: Human_mtDNA_polyA2_mod.gff (contains polyA + UTR)
First download ref sequence and index:
Bowtie2-build Human_mtDNA_polyA2.fasta Human_mtDNA_polyA2
